From: gogo <gogo@bluedynamics.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 22:49:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] Give physics at least 40% of each frame in budget mode

When drawing (on macOS including time spent waiting for the display)
filled the whole frame, the physics budget fell to 1 ms and the number
of colliding blobs to the minimum of 50, so collisions were no longer
visible. Simulated with 16 ms of other work at 1500 blobs/s: 50 -> ~2300
colliding blobs, ~5 ms physics per frame.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013kYwHzrj5ef427USqzf3UF
---
 CLAUDE.md             |  2 +-
 README                |  6 ++++--
 lib/gl_tail/engine.rb | 11 +++++++++--
 3 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CLAUDE.md b/CLAUDE.md
index d735abc..c2b033d 100644
